l,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["看了很久的拉麵店，先前人潮都很多，所以遲遲沒有進去品嚐。\n\n泡系旨燕禽白湯麵：味道很濃郁的雞白湯，上面有非常細緻的白泡泡，湯頭很香。麵條偏粗，每一碗都有在碗壁邊附上柚子胡椒鹽。碗內有鴨胸肉與舒肥雞，都非常好吃。\n\n鹽味魚介雞清湯麵：鹽味的味道蓋過魚介味，味道意外的好香，麵條偏細、舒肥雞胸肉很嫩另外百盤、內還有兩片叉燒肉偏肥。\n\n醬油牛肝菌清湯麵：是友人吃的就無法給予評價，但友人說很好吃。\n\n整體沒有另外收取服務費，有載具服務。位置為高腳椅吧台也十分整潔。唯獨內場有ㄧ位服務人員口氣較爲嚴肅，其他服務人員都十分客氣。\n\n環境安靜、適合交談！畢竟一碗拉麵不會花太久時間，店內僅收現金。",null,[0,105]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHUmxwV1dteFZiR1ExVlc1QmVscHVSWGhqU0dST1kxZGFSMUpXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHUmxwV1dteFZiR1ExVlc1QmVscHVSWGhqU0dST1kxZGFSMUpXUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHUmxwV1dteFZiR1ExVlc1QmVscHVSWGhqU0dST1kxZGFSMUpXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHUmxwV1dteFZiR1ExVlc1QmVscHVSWGhqU0dST1kxZGFSMUpXUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHUmxwV1dteFZiR1ExVlc1QmVscHVSWGhqU0dST1kxZGFSMUpXUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHUmxwV1dteFZiR1ExVlc1QmVscHVSWGhqU0dST1kxZGFSMUpXUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7933,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGRlpWWmxVbGQ1VW5BelpuRXhjSGROY1daR1JWRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2376fd295f346a34!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjFFZVZlUld5UnAzZnExcHdNcWZGRVE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pGRlpWWmxVbGQ1VW5BelpuRXhjSGROY1daR1JWRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi