fUHHWCgGjwQ3YcHCI4CKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwj2teHvu9KWAxXGdfUHHWCgGjwQ3IcHCI0CKAw",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwj2teHvu9KWAxXGdfUHHWCgGjwQ3IcHCI8CKA0",null,null,null,[2],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwj2teHvu9KWAxXGdfUHHWCgGjwQ3IcHCJACKA4",null,null,null,[1],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwj2teHvu9KWAxXGdfUHHWCgGjwQ3IcHCJECKA8",null,null,null,[2],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj2teHvu9KWAxXGdfUHHWCgGjwQ3YcHCJMCKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwj2teHvu9KWAxXGdfUHHWCgGjwQ3IcHCJICKBA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["平日晚上約 7 點抵達。詢問店員「爆擊」是什麼，沒有得到任何回應，之後甚至直接貼上「已賣完」的標示。當下店內其實沒什麼客人，但再次詢問其他品項時，店員也顯得有些懶得介紹，整體互動讓人有點不太理解。\n\n餐點部分點了「泡系·旨燕禽白湯」、「限定·威流鴨蝦白湯拉麵」以及「油封胗心鴨」。\n主食整體表現偏普通，兩碗相比之下，禽白湯略勝限定款。油封胗心鴨上桌時真的有點驚訝，份量小到一度以為是在小人國用餐，叉燒飯反而是餐點中表現最為突出的，濕潤度個人覺得剛好。\n\n這間店放在口袋名單一段時間，好不容易找時間前往，但無論是服務體驗或餐點表現都沒有符合期待。整體感受偏不佳，是一間不會再訪、也不需要特別前往的店家。",null,[0,98]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUjJKdVZqTlNSelV3VFVjMWRGcEhUbkpOU0ZwWlZtNUdORnBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUjJKdVZqTlNSelV3VFVjMWRGcEhUbkpOU0ZwWlZtNUdORnBHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUjJKdVZqTlNSelV3VFVjMWRGcEhUbkpOU0ZwWlZtNUdORnBHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14406853831107634222/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUjJKdVZqTlNSelV3VFVjMWRGcEhUbkpOU0ZwWlZtNUdORnBHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https: